  "summary": "The saved mask comes from the subprocess script in C5: per-cell thresholds from baseline pools (base date = Jan 1 + d-2 for d>=61, which shifts leap-year base dates by one day), 31-day wrapped smoothing, then indexing at target doys 153-244, so only pools for doys 138-259 are used (non-leap years May 12-Sep 20, leap years May 11-Sep 19). These thresholds are compared with all 92 target days at every sea cell, followed by run finding and gap joining, and the result is written to output/mhw_mask.nc."
